{"4069240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frog Up!", "steam_appid": 4069240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, Rise, and Pose!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069240/extras/77f2c9063b61117978f3050fc7093a6a.avif?t=1771131595\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you know there's a frog city inside a well?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a huge well—with land at the bottom, many little houses, and even a park with a fountain in the middle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city has been around for a long time and has several legends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the most famous of them says:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“We must never enter the small wells around the city.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you know how kids are—telling them “don’t go” only makes them more curious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog children sneak into those forbidden wells to play and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They believe that if <strong>a frog climbs the highest spot and looks the coolest, their wish will come true.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐸 Outline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D action game where you jump up steps from a third-person view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you jump to a new steps, you earn points—so aim for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your score doesn’t reach the stage’s goal, or if you fall and splash into the water... it’s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only do two things:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special move—strike a super cool pose!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you strike a pose, special items appear that can boost your score or give other helpful effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cooler your pose, the better the items you’ll get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐸 Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person 3D action game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump up steps without falling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special moves to boost your score</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐸 Staff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning, Production, Artworks : Yamacoo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos, streaming, and reviews are welcome!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, Rise, and Pose!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069240/extras/77f2c9063b61117978f3050fc7093a6a.avif?t=1771131595\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you know there's a frog city inside a well?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a huge well—with land at the bottom, many little houses, and even a park with a fountain in the middle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city has been around for a long time and has several legends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the most famous of them says:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“We must never enter the small wells around the city.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you know how kids are—telling them “don’t go” only makes them more curious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog children sneak into those forbidden wells to play and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They believe that if <strong>a frog climbs the highest spot and looks the coolest, their wish will come true.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐸 Outline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D action game where you jump up steps from a third-person view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you jump to a new steps, you earn points—so aim for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your score doesn’t reach the stage’s goal, or if you fall and splash into the water... it’s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only do two things:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your special move—strike a super cool pose!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you strike a pose, special items appear that can boost your score or give other helpful effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cooler your pose, the better the items you’ll get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐸 Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A third-person 3D action game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump up steps without falling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special moves to boost your score</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐸 Staff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planning, Production, Artworks : Yamacoo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay videos, streaming, and reviews are welcome!</p>", "short_description": "Jump, Rise, and Pose! This 3D action game challenges you to climb steps from a third-person view. Score points with each jump and aim to reach the goal—but don’t fall into the water! You can strike a cool pose to get special items. The cooler the pose, the better the rewards. How high can you go?", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069240/d96f2f5d78f15ae327d6decd466dc472fad7661c/header.jpg?t=1771131595", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i